OL,4,CRestaurant boss banned over #363k      
OL,5,Cfurlough claims                        
OL,6,GThe co-founder of a restaurant has     
OL,7,Gbeen banned from acting as a company   
OL,8,Gdirector for five years after his      
OL,9,Gcompany failed to account for over     
OL,10,G#363,000 in furlough payments during   
OL,11,Gthe coronavirus pandemic, the          
OL,12,GInsolvency Service said.               
OL,14,FPatrick Hall, 45, helped establish The 
OL,15,FLaundrette in Chorlton, Manchester,    
OL,16,Fwhich closed in 2025 after 12 years in 
OL,17,Fbusiness, citing "rising costs and     
OL,18,Finsufficient government support".      
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
