OL,4,C'Urgent action' needed to protect lake 
OL,5,GTourism, infrastructure challenges and 
OL,6,G"outdated, undersized and poorly       
OL,7,Gmaintained" wastewater systems are     
OL,8,Gcontributing to the ecological decline 
OL,9,Gof a popular lake, an environmental    
OL,10,Ggroup has warned.                      
OL,12,FButtermere, in the Lake District, has  
OL,13,Fseen rising nutrient levels in recent  
OL,14,Fyears which can lead to excess         
OL,15,Fphosphorus and blankets of algae.      
OL,17,FA new report has found farming         
OL,18,Fpractices alone "cannot account" for   
OL,19,Fthe changes.                           
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
